      "cooked": "<p>Using branch 15 the start screen from redis on port 8000 is nice and show all information</p>\n<p>Trying to use NGINX give me this website</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/e/9e3b5c3c19bf7dd1189b392b4e276d3a7e23a876.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/9e3b5c3c19bf7dd1189b392b4e276d3a7e23a876\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/e/9e3b5c3c19bf7dd1189b392b4e276d3a7e23a876_2_282x500.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"mzMCo5AbIoKwYHcjqiBYzi9wVv0\" width=\"282\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/e/9e3b5c3c19bf7dd1189b392b4e276d3a7e23a876_2_282x500.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/9/e/9e3b5c3c19bf7dd1189b392b4e276d3a7e23a876_2_423x750.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/9/e/9e3b5c3c19bf7dd1189b392b4e276d3a7e23a876.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F9F9FA\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">509×900 12.2 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>And unable to login as any user</p>\n<p>Search all documentation and information on the web, not able to solve it</p>\n<p>Searching for the issue I found that under the folders /opt/nexterp/frappe-bench/sites/new-site/public/files are all empty.</p>\n<p>How to get this filled with the website files?</p>\n<p>Please advice</p>",
